# EstateVision AI

## Project Overview
EstateVision AI is an AI-powered property visualization project designed to help users explore real estate properties through images and video.

## Features
- Real estate property visualization
- Interior and exterior property images
- Property video demonstration
- AI-based property presentation

## Technologies Used
- Python
- AI-based image processing
- Visual content generation

## Project Structure
- Source Code
- Images and Assets
- Demo Video
- README.md

## How to Run
1. Extract the project ZIP file.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Install the required dependencies.
4. Run the main Python file.

## Demo
The project demonstration video is provided separately.

